            </note>
            <note corresp="#d175-f2" n="11" xml:id="d175-f2-content">
                <p>A. P. Smyth succeeded Frank Gardner as Resident Engineer in October 1944.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d175-f3" n="12" xml:id="d175-f3-content">
                <p>Reference is to the Project Statement signed June 27, 1944; see telegram 301.
                    June 27, 8 p.m., <ref target="#pg207">p. 207</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
